**Contact-forgeable bucket** (what unit forge allocates across sessions): magistral + seminarios + resolución de problemas + proyectos/investigaciones + talleres/labs + debates = **80 h**. **Not session-forged:** trabajo autónomo (56), tutoría (12), pruebas (2) — course-level residuals.

> ⚠️ **Same class of defect as FE `tracks.yml`.** FE allocated only `duration` + `labHours` and left Lección Magistral / Resolución de Ejercicios at zero. Here `docs/_data/tracks.yml` had **no session rows and no official activity keys** — only `duration: S1 · 6 ECTS`. Course totals now close in JSON + this table. **Per-session allocation is still empty.** Do not invent a timetable to make the sums look distributed.

